# API Changelog 1.0.0 vs. 1.0.0


## API Changes

### POST /items
- :warning: added the new required request property `wrapper/allOf[subschema #2]/added`
- :warning: removed the request property `wrapper/allOf[subschema #2]/drop`
- :warning: the `wrapper/allOf[subschema #2]/other` request property `type` changed from `string` to `integer`






